---
number: 129
title: Baptize Us Anew
author: William A. Ogden
composer: William A. Ogden
sp_category: "11"
topic: The Holy Spirit
notes: "AUTO: chorus detected heuristically — verify"
---

[verse 1]
Baptize us anew
With power from on high,
With love, O refresh us!
Dear Saviour, draw nigh.

[chorus]
We humbly beseech Thee,
Lord Jesus, we pray,
With love and the Spirit
Baptize us today.

[verse 2]
Unworthy we cry,
Unholy, unclean,
O wash us and cleanse us
From sin’s guilty stain.

[chorus]
We humbly beseech Thee,
Lord Jesus, we pray,
With love and the Spirit
Baptize us today.

[verse 3]
O heavenly Dove,
Descend from on high!
We plead Thy rich blessing;
In mercy draw nigh.

[chorus]
We humbly beseech Thee,
Lord Jesus, we pray,
With love and the Spirit
Baptize us today.

[verse 4]
O list the glad voice!
From heaven it came:
Thou art My beloved,
Well pleased I am.

[chorus]
We humbly beseech Thee,
Lord Jesus, we pray,
With love and the Spirit
Baptize us today.
